WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:03.069
Unit twelve. Sports I Play!

2
00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:08.877
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:08.927 --> 00:00:12.558
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.608 --> 00:00:16.390
Today we learn: Sports I Play. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.855 --> 00:00:21.288
Football. Say it with me. Football!

6
00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:28.905
Basketball. Say it with me. Basketball!

7
00:00:32.421 --> 00:00:36.371
Volleyball. Say it with me. Volleyball!

8
00:00:39.855 --> 00:00:43.255
Swim. Say it with me. Swim!

9
00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:49.855
Run. Say it with me. Run!

10
00:00:53.378 --> 00:00:57.311
Jump rope. Say it with me. Jump rope!

11
00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:04.010
Tennis. Say it with me. Tennis!

12
00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:11.377
Badminton. Say it with me. Badminton!

13
00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:18.575
Race. Say it with me. Race!

14
00:01:22.075 --> 00:01:25.808
Champion. Say it with me. Champion!

15
00:01:29.315 --> 00:01:32.749
Medal. Say it with me. Medal!

16
00:01:36.242 --> 00:01:40.175
Score. Say it with me. Score!

17
00:01:43.687 --> 00:01:52.774
Grammar time! can  or  can't. Listen. I can play football. I can't swim well yet.

18
00:01:52.824 --> 00:01:58.929
Your turn. Say it with me. I can play football. I can't swim well yet.

19
00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:10.287
After school, I play football with my friends. My sister prefers to swim or jump rope.

20
00:02:10.337 --> 00:02:11.781
I like this story!

21
00:02:12.532 --> 00:02:18.123
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:18.173 --> 00:02:19.428
Volleyball!

23
00:02:20.386 --> 00:02:25.547
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:25.597 --> 00:02:26.747
Tennis!

25
00:02:27.719 --> 00:02:35.285
Think and answer. What sport do you play after school?

26
00:02:35.335 --> 00:02:36.485
Great answer!

27
00:02:37.552 --> 00:02:40.163
This unit's value is Sportsmanship.

28
00:02:40.213 --> 00:02:42.248
I can show sportsmanship every day!

29
00:02:42.949 --> 00:02:47.744
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

30
00:02:47.794 --> 00:02:49.501
Bye-bye, friends!

